proactive-source-screen = Use screen summary
proactive-source-screen-hint = Captures the active window (or primary display) and summarizes it with the local Gemma model + mmproj. A 100%-scale crop around the cursor is composited for fine text, and unchanged screens reuse the previous summary without re-running the model. Raw screenshots stay in-process and are never saved. Falls back to app metadata if vision is unavailable.
proactive-source-memory = Use memory and preferences
proactive-source-memory-hint = Feeds the user's stored preferences and profile (e.g. "don't talk while I work", "quiet at night") into decisions — these are injected directly, never filtered by recall score — and recalls memories matching the topic before speaking (falling back to up to 5 recent ones when none match). Turn off to keep decisions free of memory recall.
